{"title":"What should I ask David Commins?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/923291786/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-David-Commins.html","date":1755265755000,"content":"<p>Yes, I will be doing a Conversation with him.  David recently published <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Saudi-Arabia-History-David-Commins/dp/0300258054/ref=sr_1_1?crid=C5IELWJBWV2H&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.aHUoWKats5QKVy8P8puPLcYSqUGEYzqubEHEfkVPHns.PA7-Q83kRZgMDaRtdUe-yHxxeo7JyfsdlncJaNnT150&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=saudi+arabia+a+modern+history+by+david+commins&amp;qid=1755258458&amp;sprefix=david+commins%2Caps%2C161&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Saudi Arabia: A Modern History</a>, a very good and useful book.  He has numerous other <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/stores/David-Dean-Commins/author/B001K8BX1Q?ref=ap_rdr&amp;isDramIntegrated=true&amp;shoppingPortalEnabled=true&amp;ccs_id=5946c5dd-20ec-465f-9b75-5fec8cfe0056\" target=\"_blank\">books</a> on Wahhabism, the history of the Gulf region, and also Syria.  Currently <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.dickinson.edu/site/custom_scripts/dc_faculty_profile_index.php?fac=commins\" target=\"_blank\">he teaches at Dickinson College</a>.</p>\r\n<p>So what should I ask him?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/08/what-should-i-ask-david-commins.html\">What should I ask David Commins?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/923291786/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/923291786/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike2